# PixelArt Trip Planner — root environment example
#
# This repository is a monorepo. Each runnable part owns its own environment
# configuration. There are no real secrets in this repo; copy the per-part
# examples below and fill in placeholder values locally.
#
# Frontend env example:  ./frontend/.env.example   (copy to frontend/.env.local)
# Backend env example:   ./backend/.env.example    (copy to backend/.env)
#
# Notes:
# - Only .env.example files (placeholder values) are committed to version control.
# - The Supabase service-role key belongs to the backend only; the frontend never
#   holds it.
